  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Edit: It's been done. Close topic.\n\n\nIt's already popular among some fan discords to manually repost any news from the official VRChat news discord.\n\nWhy not provide a way for us to just do that automagically?\n\nThere ARE users who keep up with their fan communities more than the official discord.\n\nAs the leader of Bunny Squad, I would actually like to set something like this up.\n\nI know you guys are looking for better ways to get information directly to the community. Alongside getting some sort of in-game news UI, this would be a fine method of doing so!\n\nAnd Discord has just the thing for it!\n\nhttps://support.discordapp.com/hc/en-us/articles/360028384531-Channel-Following-FAQ\n\nYou guys are verified! Let us make use of this.",
